<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef steady to weak on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice chuck and round cuts generally weak, while rib and loin cuts generally steady. Beef trimmings higher on mostly moderate demand and light to moderate offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>---</p>
<p> 241 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
